discover.body:
@Serkan_K: I got my phone screen replaced at a small shop last month. Two days later, it got broken again. I'm sure they used a cheap screen!

@NurA: I know the feeling. I finally got the landlord to fix our heating after three weeks of emails. We were freezing!

@Hakan77: My advice: always get a written quote before you have anyone do any work. I had a builder repair my roof once, and the final bill was double the price he'd told me.

@SeymaT: Has anyone got their washing machine fixed recently? Mine's making a terrible noise. I'll get my brother to look at it first. He's good at DIY.
